{c:"步",p:"bù",m:"a step; to walk",comp:["上","一"],pos:["n","v"],story:"Two footprints, one after the other — left then right. A single step, and the walking made of them.",o:"止 a foot above and another below: one pace. The clearest possible drawing of walking.",words:[["散步","sànbù","to go for a walk"],["进步","jìnbù","progress"],["一步","yí bù","one step"]],sent:["这是第一步。","Zhè shì dì yī bù.","This is the first step."]}
